      "rationale": "The crew was preparing a maintenance boundary (n-2jjl7x). The requirement states that draft preparation alone does not satisfy distribution requirements for changed arrangements (n-18qtamm), creating the condition where an unrecorded change could exist without proper barrier revision.",
